#!args --dxf :fixture
# G6e2: a DXF drawing in the demo's view (render2dtest --dxf PATH; here the drawing of --test dxf), shown whole once the
# view knows its size (extents [-59, -12, 90, 92] in 720 x 480: 0.234 units a pixel, the middle at (15.5, 40)): the
# green solid hatch at (63, 4) is x 563, y 425, the cyan SOLID at (15, -7.5) x 358, y 475, the blue 3DFACE x 392.  A drag
# with the middle button pans, the wheel zooms at the pointer (the hatch under it stays, hovered: orange over green), a
# click picks it (selected: blue over green, the pointer away), Esc clears
wait 600
expect pixel 563 425 #00FF00
expect pixel 358 475 #00FFFF
expect pixel 392 475 #0000FF
drag 300,300 350,300 middle
wait 200
expect pixel 613 425 #00FF00
expect pixel 408 475 #00FFFF
wheel 613,425 120
wait 200
expect pixel 613 425 #DF9A17
click 613,425
wait 200
move 700,60
wait 200
expect pixel 613 425 #178BBF
key esc
wait 200
expect pixel 613 425 #00FF00
